msgid "Each signs you in once if you lose your authenticator app. Shown only now: keep them apart from your phone."
msgstr "丢失身份验证器应用时，每个恢复码可登录一次。只在此时显示：请与手机分开保存。"

msgid "Enter the 6-digit code it shows"
msgstr "输入它显示的 6 位验证码"

msgid "Enter the 6-digit code your authenticator app shows for Dockwell."
msgstr "请输入身份验证器应用为 Dockwell 显示的 6 位验证码。"

