msgstr "身份验证器应用的二维码"

msgid "Recovery codes"
msgstr "恢复码"

msgid "Replace codes"
msgstr "替换恢复码"

msgid "Save your recovery codes"
msgstr "保存你的恢复码"

msgid "Scan this code with the app."
msgstr "用应用扫描这个二维码。"

msgid "Set up"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Set up an authenticator app"
msgstr "设置身份验证器应用"

msgid "Such as 1Password, Google Authenticator or Aegis"
msgstr "例如 1Password、Google Authenticator 或 Aegis"

msgid "Ten new codes replace your {left}, which stop working at once."
msgstr "十个新恢复码会替换你现有的 {left} 个，旧的立即失效。"

msgid "The authenticator app isn't set up yet"
msgstr "身份验证器应用尚未设置"

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Turn off and delete codes"
msgstr "关闭并删除恢复码"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "开启"

msgid "Claim it with the link the install printed. For a new one, run this on {name}:"
msgstr "用安装时输出的链接认领它。要获取新链接，请在 {name} 上运行："

msgid "No owner yet"
msgstr "还没有所有者"

msgid "{name} has no owner yet"
msgstr "{name} 还没有所有者"

msgid "{browser} on {os}"
msgstr "{os} 上的 {browser}"

msgid "Only a developer or more can do this. Ask an admin to change your role."
msgstr "只有开发者或更高角色才能执行此操作。请让管理员更改你的角色。"

msgid "Only an admin or the owner can do this. Ask one of them."
msgstr "只有管理员或所有者才能执行此操作。请联系其中一位。"

msgid "Only the owner can do this."
msgstr "只有所有者才能执行此操作。"

msgid "This environment is protected, so an admin or the owner does this. Ask one of them."
msgstr "此环境受保护，因此由管理员或所有者执行此操作。请联系其中一位。"

msgid "You hold no role in this project. Ask an admin to add you."
msgstr "你在此项目中没有角色。请让管理员添加你。"

msgid "API tokens can't remove data, cut off access, reveal a secret, reach a server's files, processes or terminal, rename the install, or change how you sign in and your tokens. Sign in and do it in the panel."
msgstr "API 令牌不能删除数据、切断访问、显示密钥、访问服务器上的文件、进程或终端、重命名此安装，也不能更改你的登录方式和令牌。请登录后在面板中操作。"

msgid "Adding a passkey needs one you have for this address, and you have none here. Sign out, sign in again with a code, a recovery code or a link from dockwell recover, then add it within 10 minutes."
msgstr "添加通行密钥需要用你在此地址已有的通行密钥确认，而你在这里还没有。请退出登录，再用验证码、恢复码或 dockwell recover 给出的链接重新登录，然后在 10 分钟内添加。"

msgid "Code sign-in is locked after 10 wrong codes in a row. Sign in with a passkey or a recovery code, or run dockwell recover on the server, then unlock it under Profile and security."
msgstr "连续输错 10 次验证码后，验证码登录已锁定。请用通行密钥或恢复码登录，或在服务器上运行 dockwell recover，然后在“个人资料和安全”中解锁。"

msgid "Invites need the panel's domain, as the link uses it and the invited person's passkey is made there. Set DOCKWELL_DOMAIN for the service, then invite."
msgstr "邀请需要面板的域名，因为链接使用该域名，受邀者的通行密钥也在那里创建。请为服务设置 DOCKWELL_DOMAIN，然后再邀请。"

msgid "Passkeys need a hostname, not an IP address. Open the panel at http://localhost on the same port."
msgstr "通行密钥需要主机名，不能用 IP 地址。请在同一端口上打开 http://localhost 访问面板。"

msgid "Something went wrong. Try again."
msgstr "出了点问题。请重试。"

msgid "That API token is read-only, so it can't make changes. Create a read-write token in Settings, under API tokens."
msgstr "这个 API 令牌是只读的，无法做出更改。请在设置的 API 令牌中创建一个可读写的令牌。"

msgid "That API token is unknown, revoked or expired. Check you copied all of it, or create a new one in Settings, under API tokens."
msgstr "这个 API 令牌无法识别、已被撤销或已过期。请检查是否完整复制，或在设置的 API 令牌中创建一个新的。"

msgid "That code didn't work. Check the email and the code, then try again."
msgstr "这个验证码无效。请检查邮箱和验证码，然后重试。"

msgid "That code doesn't match. Check that your phone's clock is right, then enter the current code."
msgstr "验证码不匹配。请确认手机时间准确，然后输入当前的验证码。"

msgid "That code was already used. Wait for the next one in your authenticator app."
msgstr "这个验证码已经用过了。请等待身份验证器应用中的下一个。"

msgid "That needs your passkey just now, and the confirmation was missing, used or expired. Try again, and confirm when your browser asks."
msgstr "此操作需要你刚刚用通行密钥确认，但确认缺失、已用过或已过期。请重试，并在浏览器询问时确认。"

msgid "That passkey is already registered. Use it to sign in, or pick another device or security key."
msgstr "这个通行密钥已经注册过了。请用它登录，或选择其他设备或安全密钥。"

msgid "That passkey isn't registered for this address, or it couldn't be verified. Try another passkey, or sign in with a code."
msgstr "这个通行密钥没有为此地址注册，或无法验证。请尝试其他通行密钥，或用验证码登录。"

msgid "That passkey reported a lower use count than before, which happens when a passkey is copied, so it no longer signs in. Sign in another way and remove it under Profile and security."
msgstr "这个通行密钥报告的使用次数比之前少，这在通行密钥被复制时会发生，所以它已不能再用于登录。请用其他方式登录，然后在“个人资料和安全”中移除它。"

msgid "That person signs in here already. Change what they hold in Members instead."
msgstr "此人已经可以登录这里。请改为在“成员”中更改其角色。"

msgid "That takes a passkey, and there's none for this address yet. Add one under Profile and security."
msgstr "这需要通行密钥，而此地址还没有。请在“个人资料和安全”中添加。"

msgid "That was the last try. 5 wrong codes ended this setup, and its key no longer works. Close this and set it up again, which asks for your passkey."
msgstr "这是最后一次尝试。输错 5 次验证码已结束此次设置，其密钥不再有效。请关闭此处并重新设置，届时需要用通行密钥确认。"

msgid "That would leave you no way to sign in. Add another passkey or an authenticator app first."
msgstr "这样你将无法登录。请先添加另一个通行密钥或身份验证器应用。"

msgid "The browser couldn't finish with the passkey. Try again, or use another device."
msgstr "浏览器未能完成通行密钥操作。请重试，或换一台设备。"

msgid "The control plane couldn't check your session just now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "控制平面暂时无法检查你的会话。请稍后重试。"

msgid "The control plane doesn't answer at this address. Open the panel through your SSH tunnel at http://localhost, or on its domain."
msgstr "控制平面不在这个地址上响应。请通过 SSH 隧道在 http://localhost 打开面板，或在它的域名上打开。"

msgid "The control plane refused this because it didn't come from the panel's own address. Open the panel at its usual address and try there."
msgstr "控制平面拒绝了这个请求，因为它不是从面板自己的地址发出的。请在面板的常用地址打开它，然后在那里重试。"

msgid "The owner asks everyone for their passkey at least as often as that, so it isn't open to you. Pick one above it."
msgstr "所有者要求每个人验证通行密钥的频率不低于此，因此你不能选择它。请选择更严格的一项。"

msgid "The passkey prompt closed before it finished. Try again when you're ready."
msgstr "通行密钥提示在完成前关闭了。准备好后请重试。"

msgid "The passkey request expired. Try again."
msgstr "通行密钥请求已过期。请重试。"

