msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会回到恢复之前的状态"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} is replaced with the copy from {taken}"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会被替换为 {taken} 的副本"

msgid "Everything in {name} on {server} is replaced with the dump from {taken}"
msgstr "{server} 上 {name} 的全部内容会被替换为 {taken} 的转储"

msgid "Files changed as they were read, so it can hold half a write, and the app may not start from it."
msgstr "文件在读取时发生了变化，因此可能包含写到一半的内容，应用可能无法从中启动。"

