msgstr "跟随 {branch}：Dockwell 会随它移动目录，每次都是可以撤销的变更。"

msgid "Give it one, such as {target}:size=64m, or give {name} a memory limit."
msgstr "请设置大小，例如 {target}:size=64m，或者为 {name} 设置内存上限。"

msgid "If a backup fails, the upgrade stops there, with nothing else done. Undoing this puts the old version back, but not what the new one changed in its data: restore the backup for that."
msgstr "如果备份失败，升级会就此停止，不做其他操作。撤销会恢复旧版本，但不会恢复新版本对数据的改动：如需恢复数据，请恢复备份。"

msgid "If it's a secret, set it in environment for the app to read instead."
msgstr "如果它是机密，请改为在 environment 中设置，让应用从那里读取。"

msgid "If that isn't what you meant, change name: in the file to give it a project of its own."
msgstr "如果这不是你的本意，请修改文件中的 name:，让它有自己的项目。"

msgid "If your address isn't one of these, or stops being one, SSH closes to you, and no timer catches that later."
msgstr "如果你的地址不在其中，或以后不再是其中之一，SSH 就会对你关闭，而且之后没有计时器能发现这一点。"

msgid "If {name} is rolled back, {names} stays as it is: what the new version writes there isn't undone."
msgstr "如果回滚 {name}，{names} 会保持原样：新版本写入的内容不会被撤销。"

msgid "Installed apps don't change. An upgrade is a plan you apply."
msgstr "已安装的应用不会变。升级是由你应用的计划。"

msgid "Installs of them keep running, with no upgrades."
msgstr "已安装的会继续运行，但不再有升级。"

