msgid "It bans any other address that keeps failing to sign in, yours included."
msgstr "其他任何多次登录失败的地址都会被它封禁，包括你的地址。"

msgid "It came from the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, whatever runs that acts on this container. After that, starting the project again starts a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. If a panel or a script runs it, find out what its remove does to {where} before you use it, as it may delete what this service mounts. If you ran docker compose yourself, don't run that file again."
msgstr "它来自 Compose 项目 {project}。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，运行该项目的工具会作用于这个容器。更换之后，再次启动该项目会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。如果是面板或脚本在运行它，使用其移除功能之前，请先弄清楚这会对 {where} 做什么，因为它可能会删除此服务挂载的内容。如果是你自己运行的 docker compose，请不要再运行那个文件。"

msgid "It can read and write that path on the server."
msgstr "它可以读写服务器上的该路径。"

msgid "It can read that path on the server."
msgstr "它可以读取服务器上的该路径。"

msgid "It can take half the server's memory."
msgstr "它最多可以占用服务器一半的内存。"

msgid "It can write to <0>{holder}</0>, which holds <1>{held}</1>, which it mounts as well. So it can turn that into a link to anywhere on the server, which it follows when it next starts. That's as good as root, so from now on any change to {name} but another tag asks for a passkey."
msgstr "它可以写入包含 <1>{held}</1> 的 <0>{holder}</0>，而它自己也挂载了 <1>{held}</1>。所以它能把它改成指向服务器上任意位置的链接，下次启动时就会跟随该链接。这相当于拥有 root，所以从现在起，对 {name} 的任何更改（另一个标签除外）都需要通行密钥。"

msgid "It can write to <0>{holder}</0>, which holds <1>{held}</1>, which {holdsFor} mounts. So it can turn that into a link to anywhere on the server, which {holdsFor} follows when it next starts. That's as good as root, so from now on any change to {name} but another tag asks for a passkey."
msgstr "它可以写入包含 <1>{held}</1> 的 <0>{holder}</0>，而 {holdsFor} 挂载了 <1>{held}</1>。所以它能把它改成指向服务器上任意位置的链接，{holdsFor} 下次启动时就会跟随该链接。这相当于拥有 root，所以从现在起，对 {name} 的任何更改（另一个标签除外）都需要通行密钥。"

msgid "It can write to {holder}, which holds {held}, which it mounts as well."
msgstr "它可以写入 {holder}，其中有 {held}，而它自己也挂载了 {held}。"

msgid "It can write to {holder}, which holds {held}, which {holdsFor} mounts."
msgstr "它可以写入 {holder}，其中有 {held}，而 {holdsFor} 挂载了 {held}。"

msgid "It can't be read meanwhile, and it goes once the server is back and the 7 days are up."
msgstr "在此期间无法读取；服务器恢复连接且满 7 天后，这些日志会被删除。"

msgid "It closes {closes}: add a rule for any you mean to keep open."
msgstr "它会关闭 {closes}：要保持开放的，请为其添加规则。"

msgid "It has the Linux capability <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它拥有 Linux 能力 <0>{path}</0>，相当于 root。"

msgid "It isn't in a volume Dockwell made. Undoing this puts the old release back, not what the new one changed in its data."
msgstr "它的数据不在 Dockwell 创建的卷中。撤销会放回旧版本，但不会恢复新版本对数据所做的更改。"

msgid "It joins the group <0>{path}</0>, which is the same as root."
msgstr "它加入用户组 <0>{path}</0>，相当于 root。"

msgid "It leads to <0>{leadsTo}</0> through a symlink, and the server's security rests on what is there, so reaching it is as good as root."
msgstr "它通过符号链接指向 <0>{leadsTo}</0>，而服务器的安全取决于那里的内容，所以能访问它就相当于拥有 root。"

msgid "It may be an older commit, or a fork's."
msgstr "它可能是较早的提交，或来自某个分叉。"

msgid "It never bans the server itself or the control server."
msgstr "它不会封禁服务器自身和控制服务器。"

msgid "It never bans {never}."
msgstr "它永不封禁 {never}。"

msgid "It never bans {never}. {counts} {lifting}"
msgstr "它永不封禁 {never}。{counts}{lifting}"

msgid "It opens {opening}. A token can keep out more, and only a person lets anyone in."
msgstr "它会开放{opening}。令牌可以挡住更多人，只有人工批准才能放人进来。"

msgid "It reaches what the server reaches, past Docker's network and the firewall."
msgstr "它能访问服务器能访问的一切，绕过 Docker 网络和防火墙。"

msgid "It runs in privileged mode, which gives it every device and capability on the server."
msgstr "它以特权模式运行，可使用服务器上的所有设备和能力。"

msgid "It runs on its schedule, and whenever someone runs it now. Whatever it runs, it runs with everything root can do there."
msgstr "它按计划运行，也会在有人立即运行时运行。无论运行什么，它都拥有 root 在那里的全部权限。"

msgid "It runs through the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, anything done to it in 1Panel acts on this container. After that, 1Panel shows it in error, as it can't find the container. Leave that as it is: Start, Rebuild, Upgrade or editing its settings there starts a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. Don't uninstall it in 1Panel, at either point: that deletes {where}, which holds what this service mounts."
msgstr "它通过 Compose 项目 {project} 运行。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，在 1Panel 中对它的任何操作都会作用于这个容器。更换之后，1Panel 会显示它出错，因为找不到这个容器。不要理会这个状态：在那里启动、重建、升级或编辑其设置都会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。无论何时都不要在 1Panel 中卸载它：那会删除 {where}，其中保存着此服务挂载的内容。"

msgid "It runs through the Compose project {project}. Until Dockwell changes its image, what you do to it in {tool} acts on this container. After that, starting or redeploying it there can start a second copy, on the same folders and under the same name. Before you remove it there, find out what that does to {where}, as it may delete what this service mounts."
msgstr "它通过 Compose 项目 {project} 运行。在 Dockwell 更换它的镜像之前，你在 {tool} 中的操作会作用于这个容器。更换之后，在那里启动或重新部署可能会启动第二个副本，使用相同的目录和相同的名称。在那里移除它之前，请先弄清楚这会对 {where} 做什么，因为它可能会删除此服务挂载的内容。"

msgid "It takes that proxy's word for where a request came from."
msgstr "它会相信该代理所说的请求来源。"

msgid "It takes that proxy's word for where a request came from. Whatever else is in that range can reach the route, and say who its client is."
msgstr "它会相信该代理所说的请求来源。该范围内的其他任何东西都能访问这条路由，并声称其客户端是谁。"

msgid "It took too long to measure. If an hour is too short, this stops there, with nothing else done."
msgstr "测量耗时过长。如果一小时不够，操作会在此停止，其他内容都不会改动。"

msgid "Its apps leave the catalog"
msgstr "它的应用将离开应用目录"

msgid "Its environment comes into Dockwell with it, sealed. No plan or log shows a value of it, and it keeps running."
msgstr "它的环境变量会加密后一同进入 Dockwell。任何计划或日志都不会显示其值，容器也会继续运行。"

msgid "Its last reading says so. Applying this stops before it moves, with nothing changed."
msgstr "这是它最近一次读数显示的。应用此更改会在迁移前停止，不做任何更改。"

msgid "Its volumes are backed up first"
msgstr "它的卷会先备份"

msgid "Keep a rule that allows the tunnel's UDP port."
msgstr "请保留一条允许隧道 UDP 端口的规则。"

msgid "Leave it alone in 1Panel from now on, and never uninstall it there."
msgstr "从现在起不要在 1Panel 中操作它，也绝不要在那里卸载它。"

