msgstr "修订版本 {revision} 运行的 {image}（{digest}）已不在服务器上，其镜像仓库也不提供，因此 {name} 将运行 {image} 当前指向的镜像"

msgid "These ports listen, or Docker publishes them, and no rule lets them in from anywhere. SSH stays open as this plan says, and on the control server its own ports stay open."
msgstr "这些端口正在监听，或由 Docker 发布，且没有规则允许任意来源访问。SSH 按此计划所述保持开放，控制服务器自身的端口也保持开放。"

msgid "They are {list}."
