msgstr "正在创建"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at Cloudflare's proxy, which can block the certificate authority's check, so its certificate may not come. Set the record to DNS only. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 Cloudflare 的代理，这可能会阻止证书颁发机构的验证，因此可能无法获取证书。请将该记录设为仅 DNS。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}, not this server ({publics}), so its certificate can't come yet. Point it here; it comes once you do. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}，而不是此服务器（{publics}），因此暂时无法获取证书。请将其指向此服务器，之后即可获取证书。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}, not this server, so its certificate can't come yet. {point}. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}，而不是此服务器，因此暂时无法获取证书。{point}。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}. This server goes out from {goesOut}, which may not be its way in, so the agent can't tell whether that is this server. If it isn't, its certificate can't come until it is. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}。此服务器从 {goesOut} 出站，这不一定是入站地址，因此 Agent 无法判断那是否就是此服务器。如果不是，在指向此服务器之前无法获取证书。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "DNS for {domain} points at {found}. This server's own addresses are private ({here}), so the agent can't tell whether that is this server. If it isn't, its certificate can't come until it is. If a tunnel or a proxy in front ends TLS, set tls to off on this route instead"
msgstr "{domain} 的 DNS 指向 {found}。此服务器自身的地址都是私有地址（{here}），因此 Agent 无法判断它是否指向此服务器。如果不是，在指向此服务器之前无法获取证书。如果前面有隧道或代理负责终止 TLS，请改为把此路由的 tls 设为 off"

msgid "Deleting"
msgstr "正在删除"

msgid "Deploy {image}"
msgstr "部署 {image}"

msgid "Deployed {commit}"
msgstr "已部署 {commit}"

msgid "Deployed {image}"
msgstr "已部署 {image}"

msgid "Deploying {image}"
msgstr "正在部署 {image}"

msgid "Docker starts {list} again when {server} next restarts, which may take port 80 or 443 from the proxy, and stop this route answering. Keep it stopped with docker update --restart=no {command}"
msgstr "{server} 下次重启时，Docker 会再次启动 {list}，它可能从代理手中夺走 80 或 443 端口，使此路由无法响应。请用 docker update --restart=no {command} 让它保持停止"

msgid "Docker's socket at {path}, which gives control of Docker on the server, the same as root"
msgstr "位于 {path} 的 Docker 套接字，可控制服务器上的 Docker，等同于 root 权限"

msgid "Dockwell can't read where {cantTell} really lands, so it can't say two containers wouldn't write to one place, and the old one stops first. If the app can, set its rollout order to start first"
msgstr "Dockwell 无法读取 {cantTell} 的实际位置，因此无法确定两个容器不会写入同一处，所以旧容器先停止。如果应用支持，请将其发布顺序设置为先启动"

msgid "From the API"
msgstr "来自 API"

msgid "From the CLI"
msgstr "来自 CLI"

msgid "From the panel"
msgstr "来自面板"

msgid "HTTPS on {path}, which stops: https:// addresses get an error, and browsers that saw HSTS from it refuse plain HTTP until that runs out"
msgstr "{path} 上的 HTTPS，它将停止：https:// 地址会报错，见过其 HSTS 的浏览器在该设置到期前也会拒绝纯 HTTP"

msgid "If the new one doesn't come up, nothing of this runs, and a restart has nothing to go back to"
msgstr "如果新容器无法启动，此服务将没有任何容器运行，而重启没有可回退的版本"

msgid "In a shell on the control server"
msgstr "在控制服务器的 shell 中"

msgid "It also removes {extra} more containers of this service, which a rollout that stopped partway or docker compose up --scale left"
msgstr "它还会移除此服务的另外 {extra} 个容器，它们是中途停止的发布或 docker compose up --scale 留下的"

msgid "It answers anyone who can reach {server} on port 80, over plain HTTP, around whatever is in front of it"
msgstr "它通过纯 HTTP 响应任何能访问 {server} 80 端口的人，绕过它前面的任何东西"

msgid "It answers only what runs on {server} itself, such as a tunnel on its own network. Anyone else gets what a name with no route gets"
msgstr "它只响应在 {server} 本机上运行的程序，例如使用其自身网络的隧道。其他人得到的结果和访问没有路由的域名一样"

msgid "It answers only {list}. Anyone else gets what a name with no route gets"
msgstr "它只响应 {list}。其他人得到的结果和访问没有路由的域名一样"

msgid "It has to stay healthy for {soak}. If it isn't healthy within {healthyWithin}, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "它必须保持健康 {soak}。如果在 {healthyWithin} 内未恢复健康，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "It has to stay healthy for {soak}. If it isn't healthy within {healthyWithin}, the new one goes, and what was stopped stays stopped"
msgstr "它必须保持健康 {soak}。如果在 {healthyWithin} 内未恢复健康，新容器会被移除，已停止的容器保持停止"

msgid "Its image keeps data at {imageData}, which two containers mustn't write to at once, so the old one stops first. If the app can, set its rollout order to start first"
msgstr "其镜像将数据保存在 {imageData}，两个容器不能同时写入，因此旧容器会先停止。如果应用支持同时写入，请将其发布顺序设置为先启动"

msgid "Its image puts an empty volume there. {source} stays on the server, as it was"
msgstr "其镜像会在那里放置一个空卷。{source} 原样保留在服务器上"

msgid "Its rollout order says to stop first, so there are never two"
msgstr "其发布顺序设置为先停止，因此不会同时存在两个容器"

msgid "Let go of"
msgstr "放开"

msgid "Letting go of"
msgstr "正在放开"

msgid "Listening there now: {listening}"
msgstr "目前在此监听的是：{listening}"

msgid "No route on {server} takes a certificate after this, so {proxy} frees ports {ports}. Its routes that take none go on answering"
msgstr "此后 {server} 上没有路由需要证书，因此 {proxy} 会释放端口 {ports}。不需要证书的路由会继续响应"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it has kept running for {soak}, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器持续运行 {soak} 后接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果做不到，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it has kept running for {soak}, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what runs stays"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器持续运行 {soak} 后接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果做不到，新容器会被移除，正在运行的容器保留"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it starts, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器启动后即接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果它没有启动，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so a new container takes over once it starts, and what runs goes on serving until then. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what runs stays"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此新容器启动后即接管，在此之前正在运行的容器继续提供服务。如果它没有启动，新容器会被移除，正在运行的容器保留"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it has to keep running for {soak}. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它必须持续运行 {soak}。如果做不到，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it has to keep running for {soak}. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what was stopped stays stopped"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它必须持续运行 {soak}。如果做不到，新容器会被移除，已停止的容器保持停止"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it only has to start. If it doesn't, Dockwell rolls this back"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它只需启动。如果它没有启动，Dockwell 会回滚此更改"

msgid "Nothing checks it, so it only has to start. If it doesn't, the new one goes, and what was stopped stays stopped"
msgstr "没有任何检查，因此它只需启动。如果它没有启动，新容器会被移除，已停止的容器保持停止"

msgid "Nothing listens on port {number} yet, so this answers 502 until something does"
msgstr "端口 {number} 上还没有任何程序在监听，所以在有程序监听之前它会返回 502"

msgid "On {networks}, other services can reach the new container by its service's name and by {names} before it has passed its check, beside the old one, as Docker can't add a name to a container later"
msgstr "在 {networks} 上，新容器通过检查之前，其他服务就可以通过其服务名称和 {names} 与旧容器一样访问到它，因为 Docker 无法在之后为容器添加名称"

msgid "On {networks}, other services can reach the new container by its service's name before it has passed its check, beside the old one, as Docker can't add a name to a container later"
msgstr "在 {networks} 上，其他服务可以在新容器通过检查之前通过服务名访问到它，与旧容器并存，因为 Docker 无法在之后为容器添加名称"

msgid "Planned"
msgstr "已计划"

msgid "Point an A or AAAA record at this server's public address"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器公网地址的 A 或 AAAA 记录"

msgid "Point an A record at this server's public address. Dockwell only sees {here} here, which are private, so the internet can't reach it"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器公网地址的 A 记录。Dockwell 在这里只能看到 {here}，这些都是私有地址，互联网无法访问"

msgid "Point an A record at this server's public address. Dockwell only sees {here} here, which is private, so the internet can't reach it"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器公网地址的 A 记录。Dockwell 在这里只能看到 {here}，这是私有地址，互联网无法访问"

msgid "Point an {goesOutRecord} record at {goesOut}, which is how this server reaches the internet. If it's behind a router, that record won't reach it without a forwarded port, and a tunnel needs neither"
msgstr "请添加指向 {goesOut} 的 {goesOutRecord} 记录，这是此服务器访问互联网所用的地址。如果它在路由器之后，没有端口转发时该记录无法到达它，而隧道两者都不需要"

msgid "Point an {record} record at this server, {either}"
msgstr "请添加指向此服务器 {either} 的 {record} 记录"

msgid "Publish port"
msgstr "发布端口"

msgid "Publish port {port}"
msgstr "发布端口 {port}"

msgid "Published port"
msgstr "已发布端口"

msgid "Published port {port}"
msgstr "已发布端口 {port}"

msgid "Publishing port {port}"
msgstr "正在发布端口 {port}"

