msgid "That lets {who} reach port {number}, and what's there sees each caller as this server, 127.0.0.1, which an app that trusts localhost will believe"
msgstr "这让{who}能访问端口 {number}，而那里的程序会把每个调用者都看作此服务器本身（127.0.0.1），信任 localhost 的应用会相信这一点"

