msgstr "面板"

msgid "The panel takes those ports back for its domain, {panelDomain}. Its address, passkeys and sessions stay as they are"
msgstr "面板将为其域名 {panelDomain} 收回这些端口。它的地址、通行密钥和会话都保持不变"

msgid "The panel's domain, {panelDomain}, moves behind {proxy}. Its address, passkeys and sessions stay as they are, and it keeps its present certificate until {proxy} has its own. HTTPS on it is down for a moment as the ports change hands; the SSH tunnel keeps working"
msgstr "面板的域名 {panelDomain} 将转到 {proxy} 之后。它的地址、通行密钥和会话都保持不变，并继续使用现有证书，直到 {proxy} 获得自己的证书。端口交接时，该域名的 HTTPS 会短暂中断；SSH 隧道仍可使用"

msgid "The route {edited} was edited by hand, and Dockwell leaves it as it is, so the new container has to keep the old one's address, and the old one stops first. Revert or adopt the edit to roll"
msgstr "路由 {edited} 已被手动修改，Dockwell 不会改动它，因此新容器必须沿用旧容器的地址，旧容器先停止。还原或采纳该修改后即可滚动发布"

msgid "This is the first route on {server} that takes a certificate, so {proxy} takes ports {ports} too, and nothing it serves stops"
msgstr "这是 {server} 上第一条需要证书的路由，因此 {proxy} 还会占用端口 {ports}，它提供的服务都不会停止"

msgid "This is the last route on {server}, so {proxy} stops, and ports {ports} are free. Its certificates stay on the server for when a route comes back"
msgstr "这是 {server} 上的最后一条路由，因此 {proxy} 将停止并释放端口 {ports}。证书会保留在服务器上，以便日后再次添加路由时使用"

msgid "This reloads the proxy on {server}, which can reset a connection on its way in to any site there, and lose a POST on a kept HTTP/1.1 connection. A browser sends such a request again, and an app's own client may not"
msgstr "这会重新加载 {server} 上的代理，可能重置正在进入该服务器上任何站点的连接，并可能丢失保持连接的 HTTP/1.1 上的 POST 请求。浏览器会再次发送此类请求，而应用自身的客户端可能不会"

msgid "This server is behind carrier NAT ({here}), so a DNS record can't reach it, and neither can a forwarded port. Use a tunnel, which needs neither"
msgstr "此服务器位于运营商级 NAT 之后（{here}），DNS 记录和端口转发都无法到达它。请使用隧道，两者都不需要"

msgid "Took on"
msgstr "已接管"

msgid "Traffic for this route reaches {server} unencrypted, as TLS ends before it. That's fine on a tunnel or a private network, and not on the open internet, where anyone on the way can read it"
msgstr "此路由的流量以未加密的方式到达 {server}，因为 TLS 在到达它之前就已终止。在隧道或私有网络上这没有问题；在开放的互联网上则不行，沿途的任何人都能读取这些流量"

msgid "Two containers can't publish {ports} at once, so the old one stops first"
msgstr "两个容器不能同时发布 {ports}，因此旧容器会先停止"

msgid "Two containers mustn't write to the server path {paths} at once, so the old one stops first. If the app can, set its rollout order to start first"
msgstr "两个容器不能同时写入服务器路径 {paths}，因此旧容器会先停止。如果应用支持同时写入，请将其发布顺序设置为先启动"

msgid "Two containers mustn't write to the volume {volumes} at once, so the old one stops first. If the app can, set its rollout order to start first"
msgstr "两个容器不能同时写入卷 {volumes}，因此旧容器会先停止。如果应用支持同时写入，请将其发布顺序设置为先启动"

